description:
Since 1915, Intea is all about the health and beauty of your hair. We rely on advanced formulas and a team of experts that works relentlessly to develop cruelty free and natural products that protect your hair. Our blond highlights shampoo makes no exception. With a mild formula that gently cleanses and hydrated the scalp, this daily shampoo for blonde hair is a simple and safe option for refreshing the blonde shade of your hair, whether dyed or natural.

What makes this product special?

This amazing revitalizing shampoo is rich in chamomile extract that provides everything you need to make your hair shine and enhance your golden locks. The blonde hair shampoo is a simple and chemical-free option for bringing out the best in your blonde hair. This chamomile extract shampoo is easy to use and 100% cruelty-free. With more than 100 years in the market, we are happy to have built a trustworthy brand loved by people all over the world.

Some features to keep in mind about our product:

Suitable for adults and kids;
Enhances blonde highlights;
Rich in chamomile extract;
Mild cleansing power for daily use;
Free from parabens, alcohol, and ammonia;
Does not contain hydrogen peroxide or chemical dye;
Quantity: 8.5oz (250ml);
Original formula developed and tested by pharmacists;
Ideally used with Intea Hair Mask for the perfect finish of blond hair after shampooing;
cruelty free shampoo;
Works on natural blonde hair and dyed hair;
Helps to maintain the shine and refresh blonde colors.

Enjoy rich blonde hair with the Intea chamomile shampoo!
